ated\",\n    \"deep-review-strategy.md\": \"mutable\",\n    \"deep-review-dashboard.md\": \"auto-generated\",\n    \".deep-review-pause\": \"operator-controlled\",\n    \"review-report.md\": \"mutable\",\n    \"review-report-v*.md\": \"write-once\",\n    \"iteration-*.md\": \"write-once\"\n  },\n  \"reducer\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"inputs\": [\n      \"latestJSONLDelta\",\n      \"newIterationFile\",\n      \"priorReducedState\"\n    ],\n    \"outputs\": [\n      \"findingsRegistry\",\n      \"dashboardMetrics\",\n      \"strategyUpdates\"\n    ],\n    \"metrics\": [\n      \"dimensionsCovered\",\n      \"findingsBySeverity\",\n      \"openFindings\",\n      \"resolvedFindings\",\n      \"convergenceScore\"\n    ]\n  }\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":94,"totalLines":94,"truncated":false}},"title":"specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review/review/luna-wave/lineages/luna-opencode/deep-review-config.json","time":{"start":1791271252888,"end":1791271252892}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_02e55fe3c3a1104f016ac4a154516087d283864779e80af753"}},"id":"prt_110163380001h2FYfZRkjIo8AQ","sessionID":"ses_eefeb8112ffeSAe808XV03S3PD","messageID":"msg_11015f0a9001ysg8jxuLWCq24Y"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791271252923,"sessionID":"ses_eefeb8112ffeSAe808XV03S3PD","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_PXgBxqgp0MQJV3uJRawm8jEr","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/090-deep-review-okf-adoption/specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review/review/luna-wave/lineages/luna-opencode/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/090-deep-review-okf-adoption/specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review/review/luna-wave/lineages/luna-opencode/deep-review-strategy.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: Deep Review Strategy\n3: description: Cross-check lineage plan for the v4.0.0.3 release review.\n4: trigger_phrases:\n5:   - \"luna-opencode deep review strategy\"\n6: importance_tier: normal\n7: contextType: planning\n8: version: 1.11.0.13\n9: ---\n10: \n11: # Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n12: \n13: ## 1. OVERVIEW\n14: \n15: This lineage independently cross-checks prior lineage findings, then reviews additional release-manifest areas. The review target stays read-only. All state and synthesis output stays in this lineage directory.\n16: \n17: ## 2. TOPIC\n18: \n19: Review `v4.0.0.2..v4.0.0.3` with a cross-check emphasis. The scope manifest contains 1,997 release paths. Each iteration takes a bounded slice and records exact file:line evidence.\n20: \n21: ## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n22: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n23: - [ ] D1 Correctness, logic errors, state transitions, invariants, edge cases\n24: - [ ] D2 Security, trust boundaries, input handling, secrets, permissions\n25: - [ ] D3 Traceability, spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n26: - [ ] D4 Maintainability, patterns, documentation quality, safe follow-on changes\n27: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n28: \n29: ## 4. NON-GOALS\n30: \n31: - Implementing fixes or editing files under review.\n32: - Running repository validation, build, or test suites.\n33: - Writing outside this lineage directory or saving packet continuity.\n34: \n35: ## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n36: \n37: - Continue through all 10 iterations. Convergence is telemetry only under `max-iterations`.\n38: - Synthesis records `stopReason: maxIterationsReached`.\n39: \n40: ## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n41: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n42: [None yet]\n43: \n44: | Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n45: |-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n46: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n47: \n48: ## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n49: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n50: - P0: 0 active\n51: - P1: 0 active\n52: - P2: 0 active\n53: - Delta this iteration: +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n54: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n55: \n56: ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n57: \n58: [No iteration evidence yet]\n59: \n60: ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n61: \n62: [No iteration evidence yet]\n63: \n64: ## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n65: \n66: [None yet]\n67: \n68: ## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n69: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n70: - Completed pivots: 0\n71: - Failed pivots: 0\n72: - Audited overrides: 0\n73: - Swept: none yet\n74: - Pivot lineage: none yet\n75: - Remaining frontier: review manifest areas not covered by prior lineages\n76: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n77: \n78: ## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n79: \n80: [None yet]\n81: \n82: ## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n83: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n84: - Dimension: correctness\n85: - Focus: independently replay the lead-steered cross-lineage findings.\n86: - Reason: validate high-impact claims against current sources before broadening.\n87: - Rotation status: first pass\n88: - Blocked/productive carry-forward: productive, direct source reads and counterevidence checks\n89: - Required evidence: source lines, release diff where relevant, explicit failure scenario\n90: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n91: \n92: ## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n93: \n94: - Target: `specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review`.\n95: - Scope: `goal-file-manifest.txt`, 1,997 paths, release range `v4.0.0.2..v4.0.0.3`.\n96: - Required core protocols: `spec_code`, `checklist_evidence`.\n97: - Applicable overlays: `feature_catalog_code`, `playbook_capability`; additionally review requested agent/mirror and skill surfaces as release cross-checks.\n98: - Resource map: absent at initialization, so the resource-map coverage gate is skipped.\n99: - Prior review inputs: the `deepseek-flash-max` report and `swe2-max` iteration files. Their claims remain unverified until re-read against their cited sources.\n100: - Graph and semantic retrieval: unavailable in this inline lineage. Use direct reads and exact lexical searches; mark graphless fallback in review-depth records.\n101: \n102: ## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n103: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n104: | Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n105: |----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n106: | `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Compare packet requirements with release evidence. |\n107: | `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Verify checklist claims against visible artifacts. |\n108: | `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Review only when the selected slice includes a skill/agent contract. |\n109: | `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Cross-check requested mirrors as selected. |\n110: | `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Audit catalog claims where selected. |\n111: | `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Audit playbook commands where selected. |\n112: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n113: \n114: ## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n115: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n116: Manifest: `goal-file-manifest.txt` (1,997 paths); per-iteration targets are listed in each record.\n117: \n118: | File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n119: |------|--------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n120: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n121: \n122: ## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n123: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n124: - Max iterations: 10\n125: - Convergence threshold: 0.1, telemetry only before the cap\n126: - Stop policy: max-iterations\n127: - Session lineage: sessionId=`fanout-luna-opencode-1791264733860-t333md`, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n128: - Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n129: - Release readiness: in-progress until synthesis\n130: - Review target type: spec-folder\n131: - Executor: `cli-opencode`, `openai/gpt-6-luna-fast`, effort `max`\n132: - Started: 2026-10-06T06:46:41Z\n133: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n(End of file - total 133 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy\ndescription: Cross-check lineage plan for the v4.0.0.3 release review.\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"luna-opencode deep review strategy\"\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\nversion: 1.11.0.13\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis lineage independently cross-checks prior lineage findings, then reviews additional release-manifest areas. The review target stays read-only. All state and synthesis output stays in this lineage directory.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview `v4.0.0.2..v4.0.0.3` with a cross-check emphasis. The scope manifest contains 1,997 release paths. Each iteration takes a bounded slice and records exact file:line evidence.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/090-deep-review-okf-adoption/specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review/review/luna-wave/lineages/luna-opencode/deep-review-strategy.md","text":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy\ndescription: Cross-check lineage plan for the v4.0.0.3 release review.\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"luna-opencode deep review strategy\"\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\nversion: 1.11.0.13\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis lineage independently cross-checks prior lineage findings, then reviews additional release-manifest areas. The review target stays read-only. All state and synthesis output stays in this lineage directory.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview `v4.0.0.2..v4.0.0.3` with a cross-check emphasis. The scope manifest contains 1,997 release paths. Each iteration takes a bounded slice and records exact file:line evidence.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, logic errors, state transitions, invariants, edge cases\n- [ ] D2 Security, trust boundaries, input handling, secrets, permissions\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, patterns, documentation quality, safe follow-on changes\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Implementing fixes or editing files under review.\n- Running repository validation, build, or test suites.\n- Writing outside this lineage directory or saving packet continuity.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Continue through all 10 iterations. Convergence is telemetry only under `max-iterations`.\n- Synthesis records `stopReason: maxIterationsReached`.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- P0: 0 active\n- P1: 0 active\n- P2: 0 active\n- Delta this iteration: +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[No iteration evidence yet]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[No iteration evidence yet]\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[None yet]\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: review manifest areas not covered by prior lineages\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[None yet]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus: independently replay the lead-steered cross-lineage findings.\n- Reason: validate high-impact claims against current sources before broadening.\n- Rotation status: first pass\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: productive, direct source reads and counterevidence checks\n- Required evidence: source lines, release diff where relevant, explicit failure scenario\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n- Target: `specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review`.\n- Scope: `goal-file-manifest.txt`, 1,997 paths, release range `v4.0.0.2..v4.0.0.3`.\n- Required core protocols: `spec_code`, `checklist_evidence`.\n- Applicable overlays: `feature_catalog_code`, `playbook_capability`; additionally review requested agent/mirror and skill surfaces as release cross-checks.\n- Resource map: absent at initialization, so the resource-map coverage gate is skipped.\n- Prior review inputs: the `deepseek-flash-max` report and `swe2-max` iteration files. Their claims remain unverified until re-read against their cited sources.\n- Graph and semantic retrieval: unavailable in this inline lineage. Use direct reads and exact lexical searches; mark graphless fallback in review-depth records.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Compare packet requirements with release evidence. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Verify checklist claims against visible artifacts. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Review only when the selected slice includes a skill/agent contract. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Cross-check requested mirrors as selected. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Audit catalog claims where selected. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Audit playbook commands where selected. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\nManifest: `goal-file-manifest.txt` (1,997 paths); per-iteration targets are listed in each record.\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|--------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 10\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1, telemetry only before the cap\n- Stop policy: max-iterations\n- Session lineage: sessionId=`fanout-luna-opencode-1791264733860-t333md`, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release readiness: in-progress until synthesis\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Executor: `cli-opencode`, `openai/gpt-6-luna-fast`, effort `max`\n- Started: 2026-10-06T06:46:41Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":133,"totalLines":133,"truncated":false}},"title":"specs/system-speckit/033-system-speckit-v4/068-v4-0-0-3-release-deep-review/review/luna-wave/lineages/luna-opencode/deep-review-strategy.md","time":{"start":1791271252915,"end":1791271252922}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_02e55fe3c3a1104f016ac4a154516887d29775eb66373886a9"}},"id":"prt_11016339c001sDLHStqcQRLK86","sessionID":"ses_eefeb8112ffeSAe808XV03S3PD","messageID":"msg_11015f0a9001ysg8jxuLWCq24Y"}}
